            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- Creates its own company, contact and deal (unique names per run) and deletes them at the end.\n- The contact email is on `example.org` and the company domain on `example.com`, so HubSpot's automatic contact-to-company association by email domain does not add another company: the association the MakeApiCall checks find is the one this flow created.\n- CreateAssociation links the contact (`0-1`) to the company (`0-2`) with the default association; CreateDeal links the new deal to both through its Contact IDs / Company IDs inputs."
